asn't completely despawned the player, you will see them across the entire map. Plus, it's a Universal engine, so it works on almost any standard Roblox game.\n\n🔥 V2 Features & Changelog:\n\nInfinite Range ESP: Box, Name, Distance, and Health Bar. The distance limit is completely trashed.\n\nPrediction Aimbot (RMB): Tired of shooting behind running targets? The engine now calculates player velocity (0.045 prediction) and aims slightly ahead of them. Guaranteed headshots.\n\nSticky Aim Fix: Fixed that seizure-inducing glitch where the aimbot snaps to another target walking by. Once it locks, it stays locked until you let go of Right Click.\n\nMax FPS Optimization: Removed heavy while wait() UI loops. Uses pure Drawing API. Zero lag, even on potato PCs.\n\nHow to use:\nJust execute the script, grab the key from the sleek UI, paste it, and hit Verify. The menu will close with a clean animation and the engine will start running instantly.\n\nGo dominate your lobbies. Drop a like if it works for you, and let me know in the comments if any specific game breaks it. Enjoy! 🚀","tags":["esp","radar","aimbot","fov"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/5kVYqnPw","keyLink":"https://linkvertise.com/3601903/RAYjp5C0VXV7?o=sharing","owner":{"_id":"69996e323c999592ac9eb137","username":"HumanoidPremium","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4adc16ca600a48f0d69d8b1317a81c8029f9c27533f411cbbbec1da34bc57901.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69996e323c999592ac9eb137-1776404299001.png"},"lvl":14,"status":"offline","id":"69996e323c999592ac9eb137","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.scripts","tier":25},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/4adc16ca600a48f0d69d8b1317a81c8029f9c27533f411cbbbec1da34bc57901.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69996e323c999592ac9eb137-1776404299001.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected